  "rootCause": "The original server asset-availability check invoked successful provider guards after its final actual native/raster comparison. A final guard could change its own source files while the method still returned Verified or missing-byte Pending. A later live proof check detected the stale Ready result, but the original call had not refused.",
  "repair": "Move the final actual selected-source comparison after every provider callback before Verified, native-source Pending, or mapping/byte Pending publication. No provider callback follows that final comparison. Current authentication, exact source identity, complete result budgets, provider mapping rules, output formats and no-repair behavior remain unchanged.",
